{"chunk_id": "a76766892966", "text": "As the battle intensifies, Yudhishthira and his brothers confront King Salya, exchanging rapid volleys of arrows while Bhima rushes in to protect Yudhishthira. Soon the focus shifts to Bhishma, who devastates the Pandava forces. Surrounded by warriors from many kingdoms, he fights like an unstoppable blaze, cutting down chariots, elephants, and soldiers in vast numbers. The battlefield becomes a scene of chaos and slaughter as thousands fall and the Pandava army begins to break and flee. Seeing the rout, Krishna urges Arjuna to fulfill his earlier vow to defeat the Kuru champions, including Bhishma. Though conflicted about killing revered elders, Arjuna finally agrees and advances toward Bhishma, rallying the Pandava troops for a decisive confrontation.\nBhishma devastates the Pandava forces until Krishna urges a reluctant Arjuna to confront his grandsire and fulfill his warrior\u2019s duty.\nThemes: war devastation, duty vs kinship, Bhishma's martial prowess, Krishna urging Arjuna, fate and chaos", "vector": [-0.006715752650052309, -0.024930991232395172, -0.006295604631304741, 0.023713555186986923, -0.013735865242779255, 0.032738469541072845, -0.025222118943929672, -0.011228209361433983, -0.027736390009522438, -0.022271156311035156, 0.010103403590619564, 0.012240534648299217, 0.008270631544291973, 0.0028401347808539867, 0.006388235837221146, 0.0016913441941142082, 0.03530567139387131, 0.002408407861366868, 0.0145430788397789, -0.014199020341038704, -0.014437214471399784, -0.003093216335400939, -0.0023240474984049797, 0.013735865242779255, -0.024176711216568947, 0.04152518883347511, 0.009719646535813808, -0.020550865679979324, 0.005653803702443838, -0.0035299055743962526, -0.009150627069175243, -0.005633954424411058, 0.007853792048990726, -0.00039967827615328133, -0.029615478590130806, 0.005941621959209442, 0.004330502822995186, -0.023792952299118042, 0.011750913225114346, -0.010162952356040478, 0.01271030679345131, -0.008416194